{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本女星佐佐木希，曾是一代宅男女神。</p><p>2020年，其諧星老公渡部建爆出「殘廁偷食6女」醜聞後，她卻力排眾議原諒對方。</p><p>如今已是兩子之母的她，依然保養得宜。</p><p>為紀念入行20周年，她將於下月推出數碼寫真集《20th》。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:23:57.043124+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T13:03:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T13:17:17.460778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T13:17:17.460778+00:00","content_hash":"165ac276482217f23372e243fcf6a9a82c993e89896e55ee2c19569b7cc10358","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}